{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmzxc569izs0","created":1795166282373,"text":"大纲"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmzxchg01ps0","created":1795166309084,"text":"第三关：营救冬冬"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmzxcljy4dc0","created":1795166318029,"text":"最后部分，给玩家弹窗敌对势力，然后玩家绳子一刀切方法，最后有一个拉取冬冬动作"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}